  "details": "When it comes to humanoid avatars, the minimum avatar height (20cm) remains fully enforced. I find that kinda strange, considering the maximum avatar height (5m) has long been lifted.\nAfter some thought, i began assuming it must be due to the fact the viewport cannot be scaled. In that case its understandable. but in my oppinion, 15cm would be a better option\nThat or giving us a method to scale the viewport of our avatars, since in that case the min could just be lifted as well",
